  "prefLabel": "Res 2706.01 Application Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2706.01 Application Review.\n\n(a) Applications shall be reviewed by the grant review committee at its next scheduled meeting provided that the deadline in Res 2704.09 has been met.\n\n(b) A contact person as required by Res 2704.11 shall attend the meeting and provide:\n\n(1) An overview of the business;\n\n(2) The expectations of the training program; and\n\n(3) How the training program will enhance the skills of its workers.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09, EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res2700.html"
